Package: libcef145
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, chromium-sandbox, libegl1, libgles2,
         libvulkan1, libavcodec-extra | libavcodec61
Breaks: libcef138, libcef144
Replaces: libcef138, libcef144
Description: Chromium Embedded Framework - shared library (EXPERIMENTAL)
 The Chromium Embedded Framework (CEF) is a simple framework for embedding
 Chromium-based browsers in other applications.
 .
 This package provides the CEF shared library.
 .
 WARNING: This package is EXPERIMENTAL and targets unstable/testing only.
 It currently builds against upstream Chromium sources. When the
 chromium-source package becomes available (bug #893448), this will
 migrate to using Debian's patched Chromium sources for improved
 security consistency.
 .
 This package enables functionality in obs-studio (browser sources),
 stremio-gtk (media center application), and casparcg-server (HTTP support).

Package: libcef-dev
Architecture: amd64
Section: libdevel
Depends: libcef145 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Chromium Embedded Framework - development files
 The Chromium Embedded Framework (CEF) is a simple framework for embedding
 Chromium-based browsers in other applications.
 .
 This package provides the development files (headers, static libraries)
 needed to build applications using CEF.
 .
 WARNING: This package is EXPERIMENTAL. See libcef145 description for details.

Package: libcef-common
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Chromium Embedded Framework - common data files
 The Chromium Embedded Framework (CEF) is a simple framework for embedding
 Chromium-based browsers in other applications.
 .
 This package provides architecture-independent data files (PAK resources,
 locales, ICU data) required by CEF applications at runtime.
 .
 WARNING: This package is EXPERIMENTAL. See libcef145 description for details.
